{"id": "report-cs408-exam-purpose", "type": "paragraph", "content": "408 是计算机学科专业基础全国统一命题科目，覆盖数据结构、计算机组成原理、操作系统和计算机网络，目标是考查本科专业基础以及分析、判断和解决问题的能力。", "content_format": "markdown", "language": "zh", "document_order": 1, "heading_path": ["408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "考试定位与证据边界"], "source_title": "408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "source_sha256": "566c0b77294c128fa963dabbc08516e002f8feab92858c9c99d2c1c15b67bdcc", "source_urls": ["https://www.moe.gov.cn/s78/A15/s8355/moe_782/tnull_21964.html", "https://www.kmxwd.com/uploads/images/20251015/68eef5daf0564.pdf", "https://www.tup.com.cn/bookscenter/book_09892801.html"]}
{"id": "report-cs408-exam-structure", "type": "paragraph", "content": "2026 公开考纲 PDF 列出：满分 150 分，考试时间 180 分钟；数据结构 45 分、计算机组成原理 45 分、操作系统 35 分、计算机网络 25 分；40 道单项选择题共 80 分，综合应用题共 70 分。", "content_format": "markdown", "language": "zh", "document_order": 2, "heading_path": ["408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "考试定位与证据边界"], "source_title": "408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "source_sha256": "566c0b77294c128fa963dabbc08516e002f8feab92858c9c99d2c1c15b67bdcc", "source_urls": ["https://www.moe.gov.cn/s78/A15/s8355/moe_782/tnull_21964.html", "https://www.kmxwd.com/uploads/images/20251015/68eef5daf0564.pdf", "https://www.tup.com.cn/bookscenter/book_09892801.html"]}
{"id": "report-cs408-data-structure-objectives", "type": "paragraph", "content": "公开 2026 考纲的数据结构考查目标包括：掌握基本概念、原理和方法；掌握逻辑结构、存储结构及操作实现并分析时间与空间复杂度；能够用 C 或 C++ 设计和实现算法。", "content_format": "markdown", "language": "zh", "document_order": 3, "heading_path": ["408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "考试定位与证据边界"], "source_title": "408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "source_sha256": "566c0b77294c128fa963dabbc08516e002f8feab92858c9c99d2c1c15b67bdcc", "source_urls": ["https://www.moe.gov.cn/s78/A15/s8355/moe_782/tnull_21964.html", "https://www.kmxwd.com/uploads/images/20251015/68eef5daf0564.pdf", "https://www.tup.com.cn/bookscenter/book_09892801.html"]}
{"id": "report-cs408-frequency-evidence-boundary", "type": "paragraph", "content": "报告明确说明未找到官方按“知识点—年份”粒度统计的出题频率表，因此频率栏统一标注“未指定”，另设备考优先级作为非官方复习组织工具。", "content_format": "markdown", "language": "zh", "document_order": 4, "heading_path": ["408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "考试定位与证据边界"], "source_title": "408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "source_sha256": "566c0b77294c128fa963dabbc08516e002f8feab92858c9c99d2c1c15b67bdcc", "source_urls": ["https://www.moe.gov.cn/s78/A15/s8355/moe_782/tnull_21964.html", "https://www.kmxwd.com/uploads/images/20251015/68eef5daf0564.pdf", "https://www.tup.com.cn/bookscenter/book_09892801.html"]}
{"id": "report-cs408-data-structure-syllabus-map", "type": "paragraph", "content": "2026 公开整理版和公开考纲 PDF 均把数据结构内容组织为七部分：基本概念、线性表、栈队列和数组、树和二叉树、图、查找、排序。", "content_format": "markdown", "language": "zh", "document_order": 5, "heading_path": ["408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "数据结构考纲范围"], "source_title": "408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "source_sha256": "566c0b77294c128fa963dabbc08516e002f8feab92858c9c99d2c1c15b67bdcc", "source_urls": ["https://www.moe.gov.cn/s78/A15/s8355/moe_782/tnull_21964.html", "https://www.kmxwd.com/uploads/images/20251015/68eef5daf0564.pdf", "https://www.tup.com.cn/bookscenter/book_09892801.html"]}
{"id": "report-cs408-syllabus-basic-concepts", "type": "paragraph", "content": "报告和公开 2026 考纲把基本概念列为第一模块，包含数据结构的基本概念与算法的基本概念；考查目标同时要求复杂度分析。", "content_format": "markdown", "language": "zh", "document_order": 6, "heading_path": ["408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "数据结构考纲范围"], "source_title": "408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "source_sha256": "566c0b77294c128fa963dabbc08516e002f8feab92858c9c99d2c1c15b67bdcc", "source_urls": ["https://www.moe.gov.cn/s78/A15/s8355/moe_782/tnull_21964.html", "https://www.kmxwd.com/uploads/images/20251015/68eef5daf0564.pdf", "https://www.tup.com.cn/bookscenter/book_09892801.html"]}
{"id": "report-cs408-syllabus-linear-lists", "type": "paragraph", "content": "报告逐章表和公开 2026 考纲列出线性表的基本概念、顺序存储、链式存储及应用，并建议从查找、插删和空间维度比较。", "content_format": "markdown", "language": "zh", "document_order": 7, "heading_path": ["408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "数据结构考纲范围"], "source_title": "408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "source_sha256": "566c0b77294c128fa963dabbc08516e002f8feab92858c9c99d2c1c15b67bdcc", "source_urls": ["https://www.moe.gov.cn/s78/A15/s8355/moe_782/tnull_21964.html", "https://www.kmxwd.com/uploads/images/20251015/68eef5daf0564.pdf", "https://www.tup.com.cn/bookscenter/book_09892801.html"]}
{"id": "report-cs408-syllabus-stacks-queues-arrays", "type": "paragraph", "content": "报告和公开 2026 考纲列出栈队列的概念及顺序、链式存储，多维数组存储，特殊矩阵压缩和应用。", "content_format": "markdown", "language": "zh", "document_order": 8, "heading_path": ["408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "数据结构考纲范围"], "source_title": "408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "source_sha256": "566c0b77294c128fa963dabbc08516e002f8feab92858c9c99d2c1c15b67bdcc", "source_urls": ["https://www.moe.gov.cn/s78/A15/s8355/moe_782/tnull_21964.html", "https://www.kmxwd.com/uploads/images/20251015/68eef5daf0564.pdf", "https://www.tup.com.cn/bookscenter/book_09892801.html"]}
{"id": "report-cs408-syllabus-trees", "type": "paragraph", "content": "报告和公开 2026 考纲列出树、二叉树、线索二叉树、树与森林转换，以及 Huffman、并查集和堆的应用。", "content_format": "markdown", "language": "zh", "document_order": 9, "heading_path": ["408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "数据结构考纲范围"], "source_title": "408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "source_sha256": "566c0b77294c128fa963dabbc08516e002f8feab92858c9c99d2c1c15b67bdcc", "source_urls": ["https://www.moe.gov.cn/s78/A15/s8355/moe_782/tnull_21964.html", "https://www.kmxwd.com/uploads/images/20251015/68eef5daf0564.pdf", "https://www.tup.com.cn/bookscenter/book_09892801.html"]}
{"id": "report-cs408-syllabus-graphs", "type": "paragraph", "content": "报告和公开 2026 考纲列出图的基本概念与存储、DFS/BFS、最小生成树、最短路径、拓扑排序和关键路径。", "content_format": "markdown", "language": "zh", "document_order": 10, "heading_path": ["408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "数据结构考纲范围"], "source_title": "408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "source_sha256": "566c0b77294c128fa963dabbc08516e002f8feab92858c9c99d2c1c15b67bdcc", "source_urls": ["https://www.moe.gov.cn/s78/A15/s8355/moe_782/tnull_21964.html", "https://www.kmxwd.com/uploads/images/20251015/68eef5daf0564.pdf", "https://www.tup.com.cn/bookscenter/book_09892801.html"]}
{"id": "report-cs408-syllabus-searching", "type": "paragraph", "content": "报告和公开 2026 考纲列出顺序、分块、折半、树型查找，B/B+树、Hash 表、字符串模式匹配及分析应用。", "content_format": "markdown", "language": "zh", "document_order": 11, "heading_path": ["408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "数据结构考纲范围"], "source_title": "408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "source_sha256": "566c0b77294c128fa963dabbc08516e002f8feab92858c9c99d2c1c15b67bdcc", "source_urls": ["https://www.moe.gov.cn/s78/A15/s8355/moe_782/tnull_21964.html", "https://www.kmxwd.com/uploads/images/20251015/68eef5daf0564.pdf", "https://www.tup.com.cn/bookscenter/book_09892801.html"]}
{"id": "report-cs408-syllabus-sorting", "type": "paragraph", "content": "报告和公开 2026 考纲列出直接与折半插入、冒泡、选择、希尔、快速、堆、二路归并、基数、外部排序及分析应用。", "content_format": "markdown", "language": "zh", "document_order": 12, "heading_path": ["408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "数据结构考纲范围"], "source_title": "408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "source_sha256": "566c0b77294c128fa963dabbc08516e002f8feab92858c9c99d2c1c15b67bdcc", "source_urls": ["https://www.moe.gov.cn/s78/A15/s8355/moe_782/tnull_21964.html", "https://www.kmxwd.com/uploads/images/20251015/68eef5daf0564.pdf", "https://www.tup.com.cn/bookscenter/book_09892801.html"]}
{"id": "report-cs408-core-extension-boundary", "type": "paragraph", "content": "报告明确把 Trie、树状数组、线段树、单调栈/队列、状态压缩和字符串扩展算法标为 408 正式考纲之外的课程考试、机试、竞赛或面试扩展。", "content_format": "markdown", "language": "zh", "document_order": 13, "heading_path": ["408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "复习策略与训练闭环"], "source_title": "408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "source_sha256": "566c0b77294c128fa963dabbc08516e002f8feab92858c9c99d2c1c15b67bdcc", "source_urls": ["https://www.moe.gov.cn/s78/A15/s8355/moe_782/tnull_21964.html", "https://www.kmxwd.com/uploads/images/20251015/68eef5daf0564.pdf", "https://www.tup.com.cn/bookscenter/book_09892801.html"]}
{"id": "report-cs408-review-priority-path", "type": "paragraph", "content": "报告给出优先主线：线性表，栈队列，二叉树，Huffman/并查集/堆，图遍历与应用，查找，排序与复杂度，字符串模式匹配；并说明这是复习组织工具而非官方频率。", "content_format": "markdown", "language": "zh", "document_order": 14, "heading_path": ["408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "复习策略与训练闭环"], "source_title": "408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "source_sha256": "566c0b77294c128fa963dabbc08516e002f8feab92858c9c99d2c1c15b67bdcc", "source_urls": ["https://www.moe.gov.cn/s78/A15/s8355/moe_782/tnull_21964.html", "https://www.kmxwd.com/uploads/images/20251015/68eef5daf0564.pdf", "https://www.tup.com.cn/bookscenter/book_09892801.html"]}
{"id": "report-cs408-three-layer-mastery", "type": "paragraph", "content": "报告总结：第一层会背概念和公式，第二层会手推过程和复杂度，第三层会手写核心代码框架；还要求把结构、操作、复杂度和场景完整说清。", "content_format": "markdown", "language": "zh", "document_order": 15, "heading_path": ["408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "复习策略与训练闭环"], "source_title": "408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "source_sha256": "566c0b77294c128fa963dabbc08516e002f8feab92858c9c99d2c1c15b67bdcc", "source_urls": ["https://www.moe.gov.cn/s78/A15/s8355/moe_782/tnull_21964.html", "https://www.kmxwd.com/uploads/images/20251015/68eef5daf0564.pdf", "https://www.tup.com.cn/bookscenter/book_09892801.html"]}
{"id": "report-cs408-study-closed-loop", "type": "paragraph", "content": "报告要求每周形成“看懂→画图→手推→手写→讲给自己听→二次重做错题”的闭环，并警告只停留在看懂答案会导致实际考试失效。", "content_format": "markdown", "language": "zh", "document_order": 16, "heading_path": ["408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "复习策略与训练闭环"], "source_title": "408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "source_sha256": "566c0b77294c128fa963dabbc08516e002f8feab92858c9c99d2c1c15b67bdcc", "source_urls": ["https://www.moe.gov.cn/s78/A15/s8355/moe_782/tnull_21964.html", "https://www.kmxwd.com/uploads/images/20251015/68eef5daf0564.pdf", "https://www.tup.com.cn/bookscenter/book_09892801.html"]}
{"id": "report-cs408-eight-week-review-plan", "type": "paragraph", "content": "报告的八周计划依次安排：第 1—2 周基本概念、复杂度与线性结构；第 3—4 周树与图；第 5—6 周查找、排序与 KMP；第 7 周套卷和错题；第 8 周冲刺与模板固化。", "content_format": "markdown", "language": "zh", "document_order": 17, "heading_path": ["408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "复习策略与训练闭环"], "source_title": "408数据结构考试大纲与复习指南", "source_sha256": "566c0b77294c128fa963dabbc08516e002f8feab92858c9c99d2c1c15b67bdcc", "source_urls": ["https://www.moe.gov.cn/s78/A15/s8355/moe_782/tnull_21964.html", "https://www.kmxwd.com/uploads/images/20251015/68eef5daf0564.pdf", "https://www.tup.com.cn/bookscenter/book_09892801.html"]}
